      "side": 1,
      "message": "Agreed: a parent\u0027s push could take every descendant over the hierarchy-wide limits, which no descendant can fix, and checking them on a parent\u0027s push would mean resolving every descendant. The limits now apply to each project\u0027s own files, the same at push and at load, so a parent can no longer break its descendants; maxEnabledActions is gone, as 100 files per project already bound it (1255196 PS5, docs in PS7).",
